---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = 'June 27, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure – 4aNurse"
  description="4aNurse is reader-supported. As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases — at no extra cost to you. Here's exactly how that works."
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <p>4aNurse.com is reader-supported. To keep our gift guides free, we use affiliate links — and we want to be completely transparent about it.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Amazon Associates</h2>
      <p>4aNurse.com is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com. <strong>As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p>
      <p>This means that when you click a product link on our site and make a purchase on Amazon, we may receive a small commission.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>No Extra Cost to You</h2>
      <p>Using our links never costs you anything extra. You pay the same price you would pay otherwise, and the commission comes from the retailer — not from you. It's simply how we fund the work of researching and curating these guides.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Our Recommendations Are Our Own</h2>
      <p>We recommend products we believe nurses will genuinely value, based on quality, reviews, price, and usefulness. Earning a commission never changes our editorial opinion of a product, and we are not paid by manufacturers to feature specific items.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Prices &amp; Availability</h2>
      <p>Prices, availability, and product details shown on this site are provided for convenience and can change at any time. The accurate, current price and availability are always the ones displayed on the retailer's website (e.g., Amazon) at the time of purchase.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships, email us at <a href="mailto:contact@4anurse.com">contact@4anurse.com</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
